  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 33 Princes Highway\n\nClause 9.33.2 - heritage (heritage_protection): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - heritage (heritage_protection): To protect the identified Heritage Items within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - other (development_control): To ensure that any new development does not negatively impact on the operation of the Princes Highway.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off-street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\n",
